# AI YouTube Summarizer

## 🚀 Overview

This project takes a YouTube video link, extracts the transcript, and generates a short summary using NLP.

## 🛠 Tech Stack

* Python
* HuggingFace Transformers
* YouTube Transcript API

## ⚙️ How it works

* Enter a YouTube link
* The transcript is fetched
* The text is processed and summarized

## ▶️ Run

Install dependencies:

```
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run the notebook or script.

## ✨ Features

* Extracts transcript automatically
* Generates concise summary
* Handles longer videos by processing text in parts
